  Host          : quickstart-nativeha-ibm-mq.mq-demo.svc.cluster.local
  Port          : 1414
  Channel       : DEV.APP.SVRCONN
  TLS           : One-way (server authenticates to client) — no mutual auth
  Cipher spec   : ANY_TLS12_OR_HIGHER

  Generated by: scripts/update-mqendpoint-policy.sh
